            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i5 - 2.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 3 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 (2GB) or AMD Radeon R9 270<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 5 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Motherboard Integrated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Although Ghost of a Tale is fully playable with mouse and keyboard, we'd strongly recommend playing with a gamepad for the best experience.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 8.1 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i7 - 3.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770 (3GB) or AMD Radeon R9 285<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 5 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Although Ghost of a Tale is fully playable with mouse and keyboard, we'd strongly recommend playing with a gamepad for the best experience.</li></ul>"
